to get we end up in the weeds, so to speak.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:24.910
What is it?

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:25.910
What should be done in that case?

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:29.250
How can we move forward towards truth in situations
